Subject: [PATCH] drm/bridge: lt8912b: coordinate the manual SG2000 pipeline

Use ordered preparation, receiver start/stop and rail ownership, propagate
failures through the paired host contract and retain resources after a stop
failure. Support the badge's RC-reset circuit without inventing a GPIO.
Derived from the upstream driver; prepared with Claude and Codex assistance.

